   "title": "Renewable energies",
   "lead": "<p>ZOLLER relies 100 percent on renewable energies to cover its electricity requirements. The company only uses energy from hydropower and solar energy to make a sustainable contribution to environmental protection and improve itsCO<sub>2</sub>e balance. This environmentally friendly energy supply underlines ZOLLER's commitment to a sustainable future and responsible action.</p> <p>The large rooftop photovoltaic system on the ZOLLER headquarters in Pleidelsheim produces part of the green electricity we need in our production. Our energy concept supports our goal of reducing ZOLLER's CO<sub>2</sub>e emissions by 40 percent by 2030.<br/><br/>When the sun shines, the electricity flows - the large rooftop PV system at the Pleidelsheim site is part of our sustainability concept.</p>",
